  "description": {
   "en": "This is a place where my mother had a deep connection, and also where she passed away.Kousuke, who is anxious about his future path in life, meets Jun at a dance exchange studio.\n\nJun is a company employee in his thirties. After the two of them dance a Slow Waltz together at a party, Kousuke gradually begins to realize his feelings for Jun.\n\nA love story with an \"age gap,\" where gentle and harmonious dance steps create a deep and heartfelt connection."
  },
